            "snippets": [
              "Late last year, Trump and Xi agreed to stop further tariffs and hold negotiations for a new overall trade agreement. They set a deadline of March 1.",
              "# President Trump says he must meet with China's Xi Jinping before any trade deal is done\n31, 2019, 6:04 p.m. ET\n\nWASHINGTON – President Donald Trump expressed optimism Thursday about trade talks with China, but said no agreement will be nailed down until he and Chinese counterpart Xi Jinping meet in the coming weeks",
